+            launch-time wait_stream(main) already ordered the KV stream
+            after every main-stream dependency (registry hit ⇒ skip the
+            redundant gather-launch wait that would erase the overlap);
+          * registry miss (write went inline) ⇒ conservative
+            wait_stream(main) at gather launch;
